# Sjel overlay ignore policy — IMMUTABLE HARD BLOCKS.
#
# These patterns must be the LAST thing in every generated overlay .gitignore, because git
# resolves a path against the last matching pattern. An allowlist entry above can un-ignore
# a whole directory; only a block below it can take a secret-shaped file back out again.
# Ordering is the enforcement mechanism here, not a formatting preference — which is why
# `tools/ignore-policy check` fails when anything follows this section.
#
# Nothing in this file is negotiable by an overlay. An overlay that needs one of these paths
# tracked is an overlay with a secret in the wrong place.
#
# Generated into each overlay by `tools/ignore-policy render`; edit here, never there.

.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
*.env
**/*.env
*secret*
*credential*
*.token
*token*.md
*.tar.gz
/backup/
/data/
config/machine.toml
config/shell/machine.zsh
config/shell/secrets.zsh
